            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maureen MacK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Happy to be the first to review this one. Fantastic!!!! I had a beautiful thick filet and grilled it. The flavor of the fish was not overpowered by the marinade. Super yummy...picking bass up again tomorrow while it's still available!"
          },
          {
